e seguridad</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6997">...</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6757"> </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6200">“</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7034">finalmente prestar servicio voluntario remoto desde el Uruguay para minimizar el costo logístico y tercerizar la fábrica de sistemas en España</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6996">…</text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__108668_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__107024_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2"/><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6195">&quot;</text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__108668_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__107024_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2"/></text:p>
