hasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7050">?</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7055">¿La inteligencia enemiga siempre se cae con un buen chiste o lo único que la autoriddad política teme es una campaña masiva desde la oposición?¿Su máxima habilidad es la paciencia de un lagarto?</text:span></text:span></text:p>
       </text:list-item>
       <text:list-item>
        <text:p text:style-name="P4672"><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6764">E</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6761">xperto</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6764">:</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7021"> </text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173417_406171522411111111121111111111111111111112121112122121211121213311111122131212122121121122111211113211111111111111114112111123111111111111112211111111112111111111111111111132112131132121111111111111211111212111111111211211111111121112 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__155131_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173307_3472963148131111111121111111111111111111112121112122121211121213311111122131212122121121122111211113211111111111111114112111123111111111111112211111111112111111111111111111132112131132121111111111111211111212111111111211211111111121112 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173375_212226562421111111121111111111111111111112121112122121211121213311111122131212122121121122111211113211111111111111114112111123111111111111112211111111112111111111111111111132112131132121111111111111211111212111111111211211111111121112 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7053">Si </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7055">existieran universidades nacionales más jóvenes en la reserva, deberíamos pues viajar hasta la grata ciudad de Oxapampa, antes de llegar con MovilBus o Civa hasta Pucallpa</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6997">...</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6757"> </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6200">“</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7056">desde ahí podemos tomar la ruta aérea hasta el Cruzeiro o Río Branco</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7054">…</text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__107024_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__108668_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6195">&quot;</text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__107024_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__108668_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/></text:p>
