</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6997">...</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6757"> </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6200">“</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7074">cuando se encuentren lo suficientemente cerca, es posible instalar un vallado o verja perimetral temporal como para asegurar la instalación de un jardín de infantes</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7061">…</text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__107024_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__108668_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2"/><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6195">&quot;</text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__107024_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__108668_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2"/></text:p>
