       <text:list-item>
        <text:p text:style-name="P4680"><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6764">E</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6761">xperto</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6764">:</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7021"> </text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__155131_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173307_3472963148131111111121111111111111111111112121112122121211121213311111122131212122121121122111211113211111111111111114112111123111111111111112211111111112111111111111111111132112131132121111111111111211111212111111111211211111111121112 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173417_406171522411111111121111111111111111111112121112122121211121213311111122131212122121121122111211113211111111111111114112111123111111111111112211111111112111111111111111111132112131132121111111111111211111212111111111211211111111121112 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173375_212226562421111111121111111111111111111112121112122121211121213311111122131212122121121122111211113211111111111111114112111123111111111111112211111111112111111111111111111132112131132121111111111111211111212111111111211211111111121112 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1"/><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7073">Si </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7075">nos referimos a la economía clásica del intercambio, donde más se nos necesita será donde se apruebe nuestro proyecto de servicio voluntario</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6997">...</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6757"> </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6200">“</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7076">Si sus niñas se dedican al estudio del deporte, no por eso sus hijas serán más sanas y fuertes, pero si el hijo mayor fuese un prisionero de guerra; mientras tanto puede entrenar con su tío las técnicas de supervivencia en la jungla</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7061">…</text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__107024_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__108668_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1"/><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6195">&quot;</text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__107024_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__108668_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1"/></text:p>
