</text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7078">que</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7077"> en Gitlab se encuentran contrariadas</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7055">?</text:span></text:span></text:p>
       </text:list-item>
       <text:list-item>
        <text:p text:style-name="P4681"><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6764">E</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6761">xperto</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6764">:</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7021"> </text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173375_212226562421111111121111111111111111111112121112122121211121213311111122131212122121121122111211113211111111111111114112111123111111111111112211111111112111111111111111111132112131132121111111111111211111212111111111211211111111121112 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__155131_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173417_406171522411111111121111111111111111111112121112122121211121213311111122131212122121121122111211113211111111111111114112111123111111111111112211111111112111111111111111111132112131132121111111111111211111212111111111211211111111121112 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173307_3472963148131111111121111111111111111111112121112122121211121213311111122131212122121121122111211113211111111111111114112111123111111111111112211111111112111111111111111111132112131132121111111111111211111212111111111211211111111121112 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3"/><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7077">La realidad es que si aún no cuenta con los recursos necesarios para desplegar sus astilleros flotantes desde Buenos Aires, puede viajar hasta la provincia de Puerto Maldonado con tan solo 100 soles</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6997">...</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6757"> </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6200">“</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7079">cuando se encuentran rodeadas por su arquitectura familiar, un paisaje paradisiáco o un clima inmejorable; las inmigrantes latinas no extrañarán la estrechez europea</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7061">…</text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__107024_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__108668_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3"/><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6195">&quot;</text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__107024_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__108668_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3"/></text:p>
