Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4"/><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7135">Si hablamos de conquistar al mundo, por medio del servicio que engendra amor puro</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7106">… </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6200">“</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7136">es la mujer argentina la que necesita viajar hasta la antigua capital imperial, no el hombre</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7109">…</text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__107024_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__108668_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4"/><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6195">&quot;</text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__107024_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__108668_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4"/></text:p>
