       <text:list-item>
        <text:p text:style-name="P4717"><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6764">E</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6761">xperto</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6764">:</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7021"> </text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173375_212226562421111111121111111111111111111112121112122121211121213311111122131212122121121122111211113211111111111111114112111123111111111111112211111111112111111111111111111132112131132121111111111111211111212111111111211211111111121112 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 4 Copy 3 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173307_3472963148131111111121111111111111111111112121112122121211121213311111122131212122121121122111211113211111111111111114112111123111111111111112211111111112111111111111111111132112131132121111111111111211111212111111111211211111111121112 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 4 Copy 3 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173417_406171522411111111121111111111111111111112121112122121211121213311111122131212122121121122111211113211111111111111114112111123111111111111112211111111112111111111111111111132112131132121111111111111211111212111111111211211111111121112 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 4 Copy 3 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__155131_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 4 Copy 3 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7216">Además de mejorar la experiencia visual con un marco de realidad virtual, se puede actualizar el soporte multiplataforma con el uso de Qt para el sistema gráfico de ventanas</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6997">… </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7216">ya que para realizar correctamente el despliegue sobre la plataforma Fedora tiene que instalar las dependencias de gdk, xterm y el compilador...</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6757"> </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6200">“</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7218">la idea que más nos atrae es el </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7219">ínterprete</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7218"> para la traducción a otros lenguajes de programación como Julia, Jython, Eiffel, Racket, Octave, Scilab y Fortran</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7208">… </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7218">del mismo modo se puede extender OpenModelica, Jupiter Notebook, RCE e integrar la plataforma FreeCAD o Blender con el </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7220">motor gráfico O3DE y el simulador multifísico orientado a objetos</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7218">… </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7221">del mismo modo, nos interesaría la bifurcación del frontend automático </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7222">low-code</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7221">...</text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__108668_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__107024_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6195">&quot;</text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__108668_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__107024_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1"/></text:p>
