       <text:list-item>
        <text:p text:style-name="P4813"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__173417_4061715224111111111211111111111111111111121211121221212111212133111111221312121221211211221112111132111111111111111141121111231111 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__173307_34729631481311111111211111111111111111111121211121221212111212133111111221312121221211211221112111132111111111111111141121111231111 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__173375_2122265624211111111211111111111111111111121211121221212111212133111111221312121221211211221112111132111111111111111141121111231111 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__188749_3495873704 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:span text:style-name="T2851">E</text:span><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__155131_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:span text:style-name="T2868">studiante</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T2851">: </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7285">¿</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7417">En qué área de conocimiento le gustaría iniciar su trabajo de investigación</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7408">?</text:span></text:p>
       </text:list-item>
       <text:list-item>
        <text:p text:style-name="P4814"><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6764">E</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6761">xperto</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6764">:</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7021"> </text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173417_4061715224111111111211111111111111111111121211121221212111212133111111221312121221211211221112111132111111111111111141121111231111 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__155131_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173375_2122265624211111111211111111111111111111121211121221212111212133111111221312121221211211221112111132111111111111111141121111231111 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173307_34729631481311111111211111111111111111111121211121221212111212133111111221312121221211211221112111132111111111111111141121111231111 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7418">El editor del motor gráfico en Godot simplifica la tarea de programación visual para un simulador de misión completa, pero no hay mejor forma </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7419">de</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7418"> lograr una profunda comprensión </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7419">en la gestión del aprendizaje,</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7418"> alta integridad </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7419">o</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7418"> el análisis de rendimiento por gemelos digitales que migrándolos al marco del proyecto Graal</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7389">…</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7392"> </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6200">“</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7420">por otro lado, al mismo tiempo también </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7421">es factible</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7420"> integrar otros lenguajes como C++, </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7421">Rust, </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7420">Fortran, Eiffel, Racket o Julia</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7416">… </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7420">del mismo modo, se puede extender a la plataforma Modélica con la integración en Scilab, Gazebo y RCE… priorizando en orden de complejidad a los sistemas expertos </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7421">implementados en MatLab o Júpiter, pero</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7420"> aplicados a la medicina; pueden constituir la cúspide </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7421">de</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7420"> la ingeniería artificial </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7421">interpretada en el cuaderno del laboratorio web para macrodata con Zeppelin en Clojure o JavaFX;</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7420"> al igual que los sistemas </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7421">geográficos</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7420"> embebidos para vehículos autónomos… no podemos dar por concluida a la fase de ingeniería inversa para </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7422">el desarrollo</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7420"> de un generador de energía </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7421">y producción de</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7420"> hidrógeno sin un entorno seguro…</text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__107024_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__108668_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6195">&quot;</text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__107024_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__108668_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__188749_3495873704 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/></text:p>
