p>
       </text:list-item>
       <text:list-item>
        <text:p text:style-name="P4822"><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6764">E</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6761">xperto</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6764">:</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7021"> </text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173307_34729631481311111111211111111111111111111121211121221212111212133111111221312121221211211221112111132111111111111111141121111231111 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__155131_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173417_4061715224111111111211111111111111111111121211121221212111212133111111221312121221211211221112111132111111111111111141121111231111 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173375_2122265624211111111211111111111111111111121211121221212111212133111111221312121221211211221112111132111111111111111141121111231111 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7021">El examen </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7434">FE</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7021"> es un</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7435">a evaluación</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7021"> por computadora que se realiza durante todo el año en </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7435">los </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7021">centros de evaluación </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7434">Pearson VUE</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7021"> aprobados por </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7434">NCEES</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7021">. La tarifa del examen es de $225 y se paga directamente a NCEES. </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7435">Tomando como referencia a la suite de simulación en MatLab</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7389">…</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7392"> </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6200">“</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7436">efectivamente podemos integrar un marco de desarrollo CAD o un solver de métodos numéricos hasta migrar a MathML todos los ejercicios de la bibliografía especializada a la que tenemos acceso empleando los recursos educativos abiertos (Octave, Modelica y Scilab) lo cual podría tomar un par de horas extra durante la jornada extendida hasta aprobar el examen internacional de fundamentos de ingeniería, algo equivalente al concurso de asimilación por traslado en la reserva aérea</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7406">…</text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__108668_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__107024_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6195">&quot;</text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__108668_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__107024_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__188749_3495873704 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1"/></text:p>
