       </text:list-item>
       <text:list-item>
        <text:p text:style-name="P4824"><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6764">E</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6761">xperto</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6764">:</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7021"> </text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173417_4061715224111111111211111111111111111111121211121221212111212133111111221312121221211211221112111132111111111111111141121111231111 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__155131_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173307_34729631481311111111211111111111111111111121211121221212111212133111111221312121221211211221112111132111111111111111141121111231111 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173375_2122265624211111111211111111111111111111121211121221212111212133111111221312121221211211221112111132111111111111111141121111231111 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2"/><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7438">Debido a la implementación integral de una ambulancia aérea, puede crear la relación empresaria de confianza, sobre la base de una amistad ideal; algunas simulaciones complejas solamente se aplican en los mega proyectos... como por ejemplo, el proceso de construcción de un </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7439">crucero transatlántico</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7389">…</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7392"> </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6200">“</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7440">no es fácil lidiar con la belleza americana, para lo cual requeriremos el desarrollo de los brazos; de un total de dos mil contactos potenciales; probablemente alcancemos la meta de una </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7441">veintena de conversiones anuales</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7406">… </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7440">lo cual será más que suficiente, para lograr los objetivos de nuestra motivación en un par de años… cuyo ratio se mantiene en el </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7441">1% del total</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7440">…</text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__108668_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__107024_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2"/><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6195">&quot;</text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__108668_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__107024_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__188749_3495873704 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 2"/></text:p>
