       <text:list-item>
        <text:p text:style-name="P4825"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__173307_34729631481311111111211111111111111111111121211121221212111212133111111221312121221211211221112111132111111111111111141121111231111 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__173417_4061715224111111111211111111111111111111121211121221212111212133111111221312121221211211221112111132111111111111111141121111231111 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__173375_2122265624211111111211111111111111111111121211121221212111212133111111221312121221211211221112111132111111111111111141121111231111 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__188749_3495873704 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:span text:style-name="T2851">E</text:span><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__155131_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:span text:style-name="T2868">studiante</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T2851">: </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7285">¿</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7442">En su opinión </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7443">personal</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7442"> todos los sacerdotes y magos se lanzan esferas invisibles de energía</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7408">?</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7442">¿El país ha revivido el pasado reciente de la recesión mundial o sus obreros y artistas duermen en las plazas?¿Depende del apoyo </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7443">académico</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7442"> de las reservas </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7443">extranjeras</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7442"> para salir adelante?</text:span></text:p>
       </text:list-item>
       <text:list-item>
        <text:p text:style-name="P4826"><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6764">E</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6761">xperto</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6764">:</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7021"> </text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173375_2122265624211111111211111111111111111111121211121221212111212133111111221312121221211211221112111132111111111111111141121111231111 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__155131_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173307_34729631481311111111211111111111111111111121211121221212111212133111111221312121221211211221112111132111111111111111141121111231111 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173417_4061715224111111111211111111111111111111121211121221212111212133111111221312121221211211221112111132111111111111111141121111231111 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7444">Nuestro objetivo es empoderar a sus pilotos con un plataforma modular civil de entrenamiento avanzado y gas hidrógeno; para que adopten CINCO niñas</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7389">…</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7392"> </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6200">“</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7445">para eso debemos estar preparados desde la zona templada de alta mar donde se minimiza el riesgo de un asalto anfibio</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7406">…</text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__108668_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__107024_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6195">&quot;</text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__108668_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__107024_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__188749_3495873704 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/></text:p>
       </text:list-item>
       <text:list-item>
        <text:p text:style-name="P4827"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__188749_3495873704 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__173375_2122265624211111111211111111111111111111121211121221212111212133111111221312121221211211221112111132111111111111111141121111231111 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__173417_4061715224111111111211111111111111111111121211121221212111212133111111221312121221211211221112111132111111111111111141121111231111 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__173307_34729631481311111111211111111111111111111121211121221212111212133111111221312121221211211221112111132111111111111111141121111231111 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:span text:style-name="T2851">E</text:span><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__155131_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:span text:style-name="T2868">studiante</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T2851">: </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7285">¿</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7446">Piensa que el valor agregado más valioso del servicio de entrenamiento militar mediante la simulación es la validación de la computación científica o una rápida conquista</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7442">?</text:span></text:p>
       </text:list-item>
       <text:list-item>
        <text:p text:style-name="P4828"><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6764">E</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6761">xperto</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6764">:</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7021"> </text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173375_2122265624211111111211111111111111111111121211121221212111212133111111221312121221211211221112111132111111111111111141121111231111 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__155131_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173307_34729631481311111111211111111111111111111121211121221212111212133111111221312121221211211221112111132111111111111111141121111231111 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__173417_4061715224111111111211111111111111111111121211121221212111212133111111221312121221211211221112111132111111111111111141121111231111 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7447">Algunas herramientas integradas, hacen tan sencilla la animación gráfica, que la mayoría olvida que el proceso de renderización se basa en los cálculos numéricos de la matemática pura</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7389">…</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7392"> </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6200">“</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7448">no podemos cometer errores en un megaproyecto; cuando las máquinas realizan tareas de mantenimiento a distancia, salvarán vidas y crearán más empleos</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7406">… </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7448">tampoco iniciar una producción en masa sin una licencia… </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7449">una decisión sabia, hace toda la diferencia</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7448"> entre la salud y la guerra…</text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__108668_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__107024_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6195">&quot;</text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__108668_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__107024_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__188749_3495873704 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/></text:p>
