 1 Copy 1"/><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7497">En el peor de los casos, cuando hubiere una traba burocrática, nadie rentará un helicóptero, a menos que se trate de un piloto extranjero</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7494">...</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7482"> </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6200">“</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7498">en ese sentido, un dron remotamente tripulado es nada más que un prototipo a escala para el perfeccionamiento del sistema</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T7495">…</text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__108668_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="__DdeLink__107024_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:span text:style-name="Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6195">&quot;</text:span></text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__108668_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="__DdeLink__107024_ Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 4 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 1 Copy 3 Copy 2 Copy 1 Copy 1 